          "open_space_designation": "Other",
          "description": "The proposal includes the creation of approximately 5.7m² of private rear garden/amenity space for the proposed one-bedroom dwelling, achieved through a reduction in the depth of the existing rear storage building. This will create a usable external area providing private amenity space for future occupiers, while also improving the relationship between the dwelling and the rear boundary.\n\nThe rear area will also accommodate secure and convenient cycle parking, providing dedicated space for cycle storage within the site. The combination of private garden/amenity space and cycle parking will improve the functionality of the dwelling and support sustainable modes of transport.\n\nOverall, the proposal makes more efficient use of the constrained site while providing improved residential amenity and appropriate cycle storage.",
